    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Epilog">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> Epilog</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Á sy Godes nama écelice gebletsod ⁊ lof him ⁊ wuldor ⁊ wurðmynt symble æfre to worulde! Amen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Ever be the name of God eternally blessed, and praise and glory and honour be to Him for ever and ever. Amen.</ab>
